msgid "Turned off here, but Cloudflare refused to delete the rule: %s. Delete the WPOptimizing rule in Caching › Cache Rules."
msgstr "أُوقف هنا، لكن Cloudflare رفض حذف القاعدة: %s. احذف قاعدة WPOptimizing من التخزين المؤقت › Cache Rules."

#: includes/admin/trait-cache.php:928
